{"ref":"BDB, תַּמְרוּר","hw":"תַּמְרוּר","html":"† I. <big>[<span dir=\"rtl\">תַּמְרוּר</span>]</big>  <strong>n.m. bitterness</strong>;—only pl. intens. <span dir=\"rtl\">תַּמְרוּרִים</span> <a data-ref=\"Hosea 12:15\" href=\"/Hosea.12.15\">Ho 12:15</a> + 2 times;—<span dir=\"rtl\">מִסְפַּד ת׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 6:26\" href=\"/Jeremiah.6.26\">Je 6:26</a> <em>mourning of bitterness</em> (bitter mourning), so <span dir=\"rtl\">בְּכִי ת׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 31:15\" href=\"/Jeremiah.31.15\">31:15</a> (cf. the vb. <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 22:4\" href=\"/Isaiah.22.4\">Is 22:4</a>; <a data-ref=\"Zechariah 12:10\" href=\"/Zechariah.12.10\">Zc 12:10</a>); as adv. <em>bitterly</em> <a data-ref=\"Hosea 12:15\" href=\"/Hosea.12.15\">Ho 12:15</a> (si vera l.).—ii. <span dir=\"rtl\">[תַּמְרוּר]</span> v. sub <a data-ref=\"BDB, תמר\" href=\"/BDB,_תמר\", dir=\"rtl\">ת</a>.","next":"BDB, מְרָרִי","prev":"BDB, מַמְרוֹר"}